#: ckanext/theme_ldm_tib/templates/home/snippets/about_text_TIB.html:1 ckanext/theme_ldm_tib/templates/home/snippets/about_text_default.html:3
msgid "About the Leibniz Data Manager"
msgstr ""

#: ckanext/theme_ldm_tib/templates/home/snippets/about_text_TIB.html:2
msgid ""
"The <strong>Leibniz Data Manager (LDM)</strong> is a modular research data infrastructure that enables the <strong>FAIR-compliant management and exploration "
"of Research Digital Objects (RDOs)</strong>—such as datasets, software, documents, and scientific publications. By combining <strong>Knowledge Graphs "
"(KGs)</strong> with <strong>Neuro-Symbolic AI</strong>, LDM supports intelligent, interoperable, and reusable data workflows across scientific domains. Key "
"features include:"
msgstr ""

#: ckanext/theme_ldm_tib/templates/home/snippets/about_text_TIB.html:4
msgid ""
"<strong>Metadata Representation</strong> using standard and domain-specific vocabularies (e.g., DCAT, Datacite, UMLS), ensuring semantic interoperability and"
" alignment with FAIR principles."
msgstr ""

#: ckanext/theme_ldm_tib/templates/home/snippets/about_text_TIB.html:5
msgid ""
"<strong>Knowledge Graph Construction</strong> from heterogeneous data sources through a declarative data integration system (DIS), enabling structured and "
"contextual metadata."
msgstr ""

#: ckanext/theme_ldm_tib/templates/home/snippets/about_text_TIB.html:6
msgid ""
"<strong>Entity Linking and Enrichment</strong> of RDOs with external KGs such as <strong>Wikidata</strong> and the <strong>Open Research Knowledge Graph "
"(ORKG)</strong>, using tools like Falcon and BioLinkedAI to automatically expand metadata."
msgstr ""

#: ckanext/theme_ldm_tib/templates/home/snippets/about_text_TIB.html:7
msgid "<strong>On-the-Fly Metadata Updates</strong>, maintaining synchronization with evolving knowledge and newly published resources."
msgstr ""

#: ckanext/theme_ldm_tib/templates/home/snippets/about_text_TIB.html:8
msgid ""
"<strong>Federated Query Processing</strong> across multiple KGs, allowing users to pose <strong>natural language questions</strong> that are transformed into"
" SPARQL and executed over LDM and ORKG."
msgstr ""

#: ckanext/theme_ldm_tib/templates/home/snippets/about_text_TIB.html:9
msgid "<strong>Dataset Comparison and Visualization</strong>, offering tools to analyze and contrast RDOs based on shared attributes and research contexts."
msgstr ""

#: ckanext/theme_ldm_tib/templates/home/snippets/about_text_TIB.html:10
msgid ""
"<strong>Live Code Execution</strong> via <strong>Jupyter Notebooks</strong>, enabling reproducible scientific workflows and interactive data analysis within "
"a secure, containerized environment."
msgstr ""

#: ckanext/theme_ldm_tib/templates/home/snippets/about_text_TIB.html:11
msgid ""
"<strong>Neuro-Symbolic Reasoning</strong> for both query answering and metadata expansion, combining symbolic models with LLM-based contextualization to "
"enhance discoverability and usability of RDOs."
msgstr ""

